name: "registers/totality-no-ops"
description: "Ops the engine cannot use are deterministic no-ops: an unknown node, a well-known collection without properties, a kind-less CreateNode, a wrong-kind path, a path past an ATOMIC field or into a NodeRef, an unknown field, an element segment, a Noop. Only the write to the document node applies."
